WEBVTT

00:04.838 --> 00:12.040
Kashimashi
~Girl Meets Girl~

00:13.213 --> 00:19.948
No matter where
you are, I'll find you.

00:21.354 --> 00:28.385
I can only watch you...
I can't even talk to you.

00:28.495 --> 00:32.955
Today is going to end,
and we can't see tomorrow.

00:33.533 --> 00:36.161
But they'll turn into a gentle color.

00:37.804 --> 00:44.266
It whirls down from
the sky... Love will shine.

00:44.744 --> 00:52.776
<i>When I turn around,
I always see your smile.</i>

00:54.087 --> 01:01.493
1 wish a day like that would come.

01:01.728 --> 01:09.567
I want to keep
looking at you up close.

01:10.336 --> 01:16.798
I'm sending these great
feelings that never end...

01:17.010 --> 01:21.970
...straight to you.

01:49.109 --> 01:51.077
Osaragi residence.

01:51.411 --> 01:53.379
Hello? Hazumu?

01:53.713 --> 01:55.044
This is Yasuna.

01:55.415 --> 01:58.043
Sounds good.
We are on summer break...

01:58.318 --> 02:03.517
Sure, I'm no coward who'd turn down
a friend's offer to have some fun.

02:03.790 --> 02:05.621
What? Me too?

02:05.792 --> 02:06.690
Yeah.

02:06.793 --> 02:08.920
Yasuna invited all of us.

02:09.762 --> 02:12.629
Ayuki and Asuta
already know about it.

02:12.732 --> 02:15.667
Wait a minute.
Yasuna invited all of us?

02:16.069 --> 02:18.037
Yeah. Something wrong?

02:18.171 --> 02:21.004
No, there's nothing wrong...

02:22.041 --> 02:24.669
Okay, see you next week.

02:34.454 --> 02:35.978
I'm heading out!

02:36.089 --> 02:38.114
I'm heading out too!

02:42.996 --> 02:44.657
Let me go!

02:44.898 --> 02:48.390
I have to see Hazumu's
exciting summer day!

02:53.139 --> 02:54.766
The beach! The beach!

02:55.542 --> 02:57.010
I'm going to have fun with my friends!

02:57.010 --> 02:58.011
I'm going to have fun with my friends!
Heading to the Beach with Everyone

02:58.011 --> 03:02.573
Heading to the Beach with Everyone

03:04.017 --> 03:06.281
I took it rather casually...

03:06.452 --> 03:09.444
My best friend asked me
to go to the beach...

03:09.556 --> 03:13.185
...and it was a summer where
we could cement our male bond.

03:13.293 --> 03:15.818
<i>But I totally forgot one thing...</i>

03:19.465 --> 03:23.401
My best friend has
recently turned into a girl.

03:23.770 --> 03:25.294
What's wrong, Asuta?

03:28.741 --> 03:32.734
Why are you sitting by yourself?
Come sit with us so we can talk.

03:32.845 --> 03:34.836
I like to be alone.

03:34.981 --> 03:38.007
What? I didn't know
you were like that.

03:38.117 --> 03:39.880
Don't come any closer!

03:39.986 --> 03:41.112
No way!

03:44.624 --> 03:46.023
Come on!

03:46.459 --> 03:47.426
Stop it!

03:47.527 --> 03:49.586
Why are you acting this way?

03:52.832 --> 03:53.958
Wow!

03:55.835 --> 03:57.234
It's the ocean!

04:12.852 --> 04:14.979
The smell of the sea!

04:19.392 --> 04:22.225
Huh? Does it look weird?

04:22.862 --> 04:25.490
It's my first time
wearing a bikini, so...

04:25.598 --> 04:27.930
No, it looks good on you.

04:28.468 --> 04:29.492
Really?

04:29.602 --> 04:30.569
Thanks!

04:32.639 --> 04:34.266
Sister Brother!

04:38.511 --> 04:39.637
Jun Puu?

04:39.746 --> 04:41.873
I'm also here at the beach!

04:42.215 --> 04:44.877
Didn't she just fall from the sky?

04:45.051 --> 04:46.780
I'm not sure...

04:46.919 --> 04:49.786
Who is she, Hazumu?

04:50.857 --> 04:52.586
S-She's...

04:53.459 --> 04:54.824
...my daughter.

04:57.697 --> 04:59.255
It can't...

05:00.300 --> 05:02.097
It can't be...

05:02.502 --> 05:05.062
I'm shocked...

05:09.976 --> 05:11.910
Why is Miss Namiko here?

05:12.011 --> 05:13.706
You know how it is.

05:13.946 --> 05:16.141
She's not your daughter, is she?

05:16.249 --> 05:17.216
No.

05:17.950 --> 05:19.577
He admitted readily...

05:19.719 --> 05:20.686
Tomarin.

05:20.787 --> 05:21.754
Asuta.

05:21.854 --> 05:22.752
Ayurin.

05:22.855 --> 05:24.254
And Yasunan.

05:24.824 --> 05:26.292
I don't get a nickname?

05:26.292 --> 05:28.021
I don't get a nickname?
You know us?

05:28.394 --> 05:29.862
I'm always watching from the sky...

05:29.862 --> 05:32.763
I'm always watching from the sky...
ll told her about you guys.

05:32.865 --> 05:36.995
Her name is Jun Puu.
Um, she's one of my relatives.

05:37.203 --> 05:38.465
Puu-puu!

05:38.604 --> 05:39.502
You...

05:41.074 --> 05:44.601
You can call me Mama if you want...

05:44.711 --> 05:45.678
Pu“?

05:47.380 --> 05:50.281
By the way,
what's with your bathing suit?

05:50.616 --> 05:53.483
Yeah. Don't you think
that's out of style?

05:53.586 --> 05:54.553
Really?

05:54.854 --> 05:55.843
Then...

05:55.955 --> 05:57.718
I'll go with this!

05:59.459 --> 06:01.484
This bothers me though...

06:03.863 --> 06:04.852
Poke, poke.

06:06.399 --> 06:09.368
You're so bold, Mr. Sora.

06:09.635 --> 06:12.763
Anyway, let's play! Let's play!

06:15.608 --> 06:22.571
The seasons that go by
eventually become memories.

06:23.015 --> 06:30.512
<i>I'll be happy if I can see
you smile just for a bit.</i>

06:50.276 --> 06:51.834
Ouch...

06:52.945 --> 06:54.980
That was terrible...

06:54.981 --> 06:57.040
That was terrible...
It's all yours, Hazumu!

06:57.183 --> 06:58.980
All right, all right!

07:00.453 --> 07:01.220
What are you doing?

07:01.220 --> 07:02.983
What are you doing?
Sorry about that!

07:06.526 --> 07:10.428
I guess he's really a girl now...

07:14.367 --> 07:15.391
Asuta!

07:24.177 --> 07:26.008
What is it?

07:26.112 --> 07:29.172
Nothing. It's just that you look tired...

07:35.121 --> 07:36.679
S-Stop it!

07:38.758 --> 07:41.226
I'll get something to drink.

07:41.327 --> 07:43.659
Go wait with the others!

07:46.666 --> 07:48.600
Ice

07:49.268 --> 07:51.327
Thank you very much!

07:52.939 --> 07:55.772
<i>Why do I feel
this way about Hazumu?</i>

07:56.476 --> 07:58.603
Hazumu is my best friend!

07:58.711 --> 08:02.374
My best friend! My best friend!
My best friend! Hazumu's...

08:02.482 --> 08:03.540
Cute!

08:03.649 --> 08:06.413
Yeah! Cute!

08:06.752 --> 08:07.776
No!

08:08.754 --> 08:11.814
Hey, where are
you from? Are you alone?

08:11.924 --> 08:14.415
I'm trying to find my friend...

08:14.760 --> 08:17.354
Did you hear that? So cute!

08:17.463 --> 08:20.125
We'll help you find
your friend. So let's play.

08:20.233 --> 08:21.564
<i>Ll.</i>

08:22.001 --> 08:23.127
Hazumu.

08:23.369 --> 08:24.336
Hey!

08:25.638 --> 08:26.605
Asuta...

08:26.973 --> 08:29.066
Who are you supposed to be?

08:29.175 --> 08:30.972
The boyfriend maybe?

08:31.043 --> 08:33.773
Nah, he can't be. Look at him.

08:34.113 --> 08:37.014
Come on. Let's have fun on a boat.

08:37.116 --> 08:38.583
Come with us.

08:42.255 --> 08:44.780
Don't lay your
dirty hands on Hazumu!

08:44.891 --> 08:46.688
What did you say?

08:52.732 --> 08:55.724
Stay away from her.
She's my girlfriend!

08:56.402 --> 08:57.369
Right?

09:01.841 --> 09:02.830
Yeah.

09:03.209 --> 09:05.700
That's right! So please go away!

09:06.879 --> 09:08.972
So she has a man?

09:09.115 --> 09:11.913
This is ridiculous. Let's go.

09:17.256 --> 09:18.746
That was scary...

09:20.660 --> 09:21.627
Asuta.

09:22.495 --> 09:23.462
Thanks.

09:23.563 --> 09:25.394
It was nothing.

09:25.498 --> 09:30.231
Those guys were annoying.
Plus, they kept touching me.

09:30.403 --> 09:31.495
But...

09:32.939 --> 09:35.032
I'm glad you came by...

09:35.174 --> 09:37.574
Thanks so much for saving me!

09:40.513 --> 09:44.813
Don't worry about it.
Anyway, why did you come here?

09:44.951 --> 09:48.216
Well, I thought
you could use some help...

09:48.688 --> 09:49.848
That's it?

09:50.289 --> 09:53.816
Yeah. Let's hurry up
and bring these to everyone.

09:58.297 --> 10:00.265
You know what you are?

10:00.366 --> 10:02.061
You're too kind.

10:02.168 --> 10:03.499
So are you.

10:03.603 --> 10:06.299
I was glad you came to my rescue.

10:06.405 --> 10:08.066
<i>Of course I did.</i>

10:08.174 --> 10:12.201
<i>Oh, and sorry about what I said.
Saying you were my girlfriend.</i>

10:13.179 --> 10:20.642
Well, you like Kamiizumi, so I thought
you didn't like being treated like a girl.

10:20.820 --> 10:21.787
Why?

10:22.054 --> 10:24.522
I'm really a girl now.

10:24.657 --> 10:25.783
Plus...

10:26.125 --> 10:28.719
I don't mind being your girlfriend.

10:52.785 --> 10:54.582
So soft...

10:58.457 --> 10:59.389
Asuta!

11:00.026 --> 11:03.894
Everyone's waiting for us!
Let's get back quickly!

11:05.464 --> 11:06.692
Well...

11:07.366 --> 11:11.302
An unexpected turn of events?

11:11.604 --> 11:13.401
Mr. Sora!

11:13.673 --> 11:15.641
Where are you?

11:17.276 --> 11:20.973
Then again, this situation
is very complicated too.

11:30.923 --> 11:31.890
Hey...

11:33.626 --> 11:36.322
Why did you invite me?

12:05.091 --> 12:09.619
Why do we have to cook
when we're out here on the beach?

12:14.633 --> 12:16.624
Good job, Asuta.

12:20.906 --> 12:21.873
What?

12:21.974 --> 12:23.271
What's wrong?

12:24.744 --> 12:25.870
Cooking...

12:26.979 --> 12:28.742
Cooking rules!

12:31.350 --> 12:32.214
Stupid...

12:32.718 --> 12:33.810
Food...

12:33.919 --> 12:37.252
Sublime happiness that
brings lives closer together...

12:39.825 --> 12:43.124
For a world full of happiness...

12:43.596 --> 12:44.824
Let us...

12:45.297 --> 12:47.026
...start cooking!

12:47.366 --> 12:48.230
No!

12:48.801 --> 12:51.929
Why isn't he wearing anything?

12:52.037 --> 12:53.163
There, there.

12:53.272 --> 12:56.639
Huh? This isn't
how you wear an apron?

12:56.776 --> 13:01.770
Put on some clothes and apologize to
all apron-wearing mothers in the world!

13:03.749 --> 13:06.309
Hey, where's Miss Namiko?

13:06.418 --> 13:09.387
She said she was
going to prepare for lunch.

13:09.488 --> 13:11.956
What? Prepare for lunch?

13:17.730 --> 13:23.600
<i>The only thing I, who's lived 35 years
without a boyfriend, can do for Mr. Sora...</i>

13:23.836 --> 13:28.466
...is get some fresh ingredients
and give them to you!

13:30.309 --> 13:31.833
It's tight!

13:39.051 --> 13:41.349
Wow, that's a lot.

13:41.453 --> 13:45.685
Since we have so much, let's do
this by dividing the work equally.

13:45.858 --> 13:49.726
Okay, but I've never done
much cooking before, so...

13:50.062 --> 13:51.222
ll see...

13:51.330 --> 13:55.164
Then can you cut
the vegetables? That's easiest to do.

13:55.367 --> 13:57.392
Yeah, I'll do it.

13:57.503 --> 13:59.300
Let's both do it, Tomari.

13:59.405 --> 14:00.463
I..

14:00.573 --> 14:03.235
Home ec is your
least favorite subject, right?

14:03.342 --> 14:04.536
Be quiet.

14:04.643 --> 14:06.440
I'll help too!

14:06.879 --> 14:10.815
Jun Puu... can you wash the rice?

14:11.116 --> 14:12.310
Roger!

14:12.918 --> 14:14.749
And... huh?

14:14.854 --> 14:15.980
What's wrong?

14:16.088 --> 14:18.716
I thought I brought
some curry powder...

14:18.924 --> 14:20.118
Sorry...

14:21.861 --> 14:23.522
I dropped it.

14:26.632 --> 14:28.793
We'll be back soon.

14:28.901 --> 14:32.234
It'll be fine if you can
just simmer the vegetables.

14:32.371 --> 14:33.736
I'll handle it.

14:33.839 --> 14:38.299
I can just go by myself.
You can help them with the cooking.

14:38.410 --> 14:39.604
No.

14:39.712 --> 14:42.943
I wanted to take
a walk with you anyway.

14:44.717 --> 14:45.684
Bye.

14:45.784 --> 14:46.808
Be careful.

14:46.919 --> 14:48.011
Yeah.

14:51.790 --> 14:54.554
This is only the beginning...

15:01.233 --> 15:03.599
This one is going much faster.

15:04.970 --> 15:05.937
Ouch...

15:14.179 --> 15:15.407
Hazumu...

15:15.948 --> 15:18.917
Stay away from her.
She's my girlfriend!

15:19.551 --> 15:20.518
Right?

15:20.619 --> 15:22.814
I don't mind being your girlfriend.

15:24.757 --> 15:28.921
Don't mind it...
So it must mean that...

15:29.194 --> 15:30.661
Wait a minute!

15:30.963 --> 15:34.694
Even though she's a girl now,
Hazumu is still my best friend!

15:34.800 --> 15:37.667
I can't ruin our friendship like this!

15:38.003 --> 15:41.803
But if we feel the same way,
our friendship won't be ruined.

15:42.841 --> 15:44.775
No! Think it over!

15:45.344 --> 15:47.744
Hazumu likes Kamiizumi.

15:47.846 --> 15:50.246
It's supposed to be like that...

15:50.816 --> 15:56.152
Wait a minute, Hazumu! Are you
caught between me and Kamiizumi?

15:56.522 --> 15:58.251
You're a girl now.

15:58.357 --> 16:02.225
So even if you love Kamiizumi,
it's not weird to love me too.

16:02.394 --> 16:05.022
Then it's my problem!

16:05.597 --> 16:10.694
Asuta Soro, can you love your
best friend who's now a girl?

16:11.270 --> 16:13.898
Others might not
offer us their blessings...

16:14.006 --> 16:17.669
But can you still love Hazumu?

16:23.182 --> 16:24.274
I can...

16:24.984 --> 16:26.849
<i>Of course I can...</i>

16:27.453 --> 16:31.822
You already stole my heart, Hazumu.

16:33.325 --> 16:35.486
Cooking is really fun.

16:35.627 --> 16:36.594
Hazumu.

16:39.598 --> 16:42.965
I have something important
to discuss. Got some time?

16:53.312 --> 16:55.746
Wow, so pretty!

16:58.984 --> 17:00.417
What is it?

17:03.555 --> 17:06.046
You want to talk to me, right?

17:09.862 --> 17:12.558
What you asked me before...

17:13.732 --> 17:15.700
<i>Why I invited you...</i>

17:15.801 --> 17:17.428
Oh, that...

17:17.669 --> 17:20.968
I realized after talking
with Hazumu the other day...

17:21.073 --> 17:24.236
<i>...that I don't know
anything about Hazumu.</i>

17:26.545 --> 17:29.912
Like what kind of books
or music Hazumu likes...

17:30.015 --> 17:34.213
The kind of lifestyle led, and what
kinds of friends Hazumu has...

17:34.586 --> 17:37.111
I don't know any of that.

17:38.290 --> 17:40.258
Sol want to know...

17:40.659 --> 17:44.356
I want to see and feel
the things Hazumu likes...

17:44.897 --> 17:46.762
...and learn to like them.

17:46.865 --> 17:49.527
That's why you invited all of us?

17:49.968 --> 17:52.198
Was it a nuisance?

17:55.741 --> 17:57.106
I'm sorry.

17:57.209 --> 18:00.508
No, it's not like that. It's just...

18:09.822 --> 18:11.084
Hey...

18:17.930 --> 18:19.227
Hazumu?

18:19.465 --> 18:20.523
Asuta?

18:28.040 --> 18:31.066
Asuta, what is it
you wanted to talk about?

18:31.176 --> 18:33.701
I have decided...

18:34.480 --> 18:37.677
I can't hold back
my feelings for you anymore...

18:39.051 --> 18:40.177
Hazumu...

18:40.552 --> 18:41.814
Your feelings...

18:42.554 --> 18:46.149
I want to know
how you feel about me!

18:50.696 --> 18:53.096
<i>How I feel about you?</i>

18:54.166 --> 18:55.064
Yeah.

18:58.670 --> 19:01.730
You're sort of a flatterer...

19:02.007 --> 19:05.534
Simpleminded, carefree, unreliable...

19:05.677 --> 19:07.872
Girls always make fun of you...

19:07.980 --> 19:11.347
Your fly is unzipped
once every three days...

19:11.416 --> 19:13.611
And let's see...

19:13.719 --> 19:18.520
Excuse me, Hazumu,
but is this going to continue?

19:18.657 --> 19:23.253
But even though I'm a girl now, your
attitude towards me didn't change.

19:24.696 --> 19:28.188
You're kind, and you're
always there by my side.

19:28.634 --> 19:31.330
You help me out when I'm in trouble.

19:31.737 --> 19:33.398
You're my precious...

19:33.505 --> 19:35.336
Hazumu...

19:35.607 --> 19:36.869
My precious...

19:37.976 --> 19:39.204
...friend.

19:39.478 --> 19:42.470
That's right. Yes, your friend...

19:43.782 --> 19:44.680
Friend?

19:44.783 --> 19:45.750
Yeah.

19:46.084 --> 19:50.885
But you said before that
you wouldn't mind being my...

19:51.190 --> 19:54.990
<i>Well, I don't want strangers
to say I'm their girlfriend.</i>

19:55.093 --> 19:59.723
<i>But I don't mind if you say it.
You said it to protect me after all.</i>

19:59.831 --> 20:01.093
So you see...

20:01.200 --> 20:04.636
I want us to remain
good friends forever, Asuta.

20:11.176 --> 20:12.803
I see... I see...

20:12.945 --> 20:16.142
People would normally think that way.

20:16.648 --> 20:19.913
You don't have to tell me.
No matter what happens...

20:20.018 --> 20:22.486
...I'll always be your good friend.

20:24.056 --> 20:25.080
Yeah!

20:26.592 --> 20:30.619
That's right. Even though
my feelings won't reach you...

20:30.762 --> 20:33.697
...I'll always be by
your side as your friend.

20:34.333 --> 20:35.960
Tomari Kick!

20:41.506 --> 20:43.440
And don't come back!

20:43.675 --> 20:47.509
I won't let anyone
do something like that to Hazumu!

20:49.114 --> 20:51.605
Very interesting...

20:53.218 --> 20:55.379
Now let's eat!

20:56.555 --> 20:58.750
It looks delicious!

20:59.057 --> 21:01.685
Since everyone is here,
let's start eating.

21:01.793 --> 21:04.193
Though a criminal's with us.

21:04.296 --> 21:05.597
It was a misunderstanding!

21:05.597 --> 21:07.394
It was a misunderstanding!
Now, now...

21:07.499 --> 21:09.524
Anyway, let's start eating.

21:09.635 --> 21:11.535
I'm really hungry.

21:12.037 --> 21:13.766
Right. Well then...

21:13.905 --> 21:15.702
Bon appetit!

21:18.477 --> 21:20.069
Spicy!

21:20.479 --> 21:23.004
Yasuna, this is...

21:24.316 --> 21:26.045
But it's mild...

21:26.151 --> 21:28.551
Something's wrong
with your taste buds!

21:28.887 --> 21:30.582
It's hot.

21:33.325 --> 21:34.292
Hot!

21:35.627 --> 21:37.254
Hot! Hot!

22:04.089 --> 22:05.181
Yasuna...

22:06.758 --> 22:07.986
You see...

22:08.327 --> 22:09.225
I..

22:10.295 --> 22:11.785
I also like...

22:12.631 --> 22:13.928
...Hazumu.

22:24.910 --> 22:26.878
I like Hazumu.

22:34.219 --> 22:39.987
If it's a never-ending road...

22:40.659 --> 22:47.064
...then I can see you again someday.

22:47.165 --> 22:53.126
You're a weakling who tries
to hide things with your kindness.

22:53.505 --> 23:00.138
I'm sorry for making you look that way.

23:01.713 --> 23:08.016
Looking for the truth...
I was searching for...

23:08.286 --> 23:14.953
...the blue sky since that time.

23:16.361 --> 23:22.561
Let's overcome
the sadness and be happy.

23:22.801 --> 23:29.229
<i>Should I put my trust
in a future that I can't see?</i>

23:29.374 --> 23:38.407
<i>Your smiley face is about to cry...
I promise to turn it into something bright.</i>

23:38.650 --> 23:42.814
Don't let go of this hand.

23:45.524 --> 23:49.756
Our future is just around the corner.

23:56.334 --> 24:01.465
It's gorgeous and bright on top
of the stage. I applaud gently.

24:02.374 --> 24:04.899
Next time on Kashimashi
~Girl Meets Girl~.

24:05.043 --> 24:06.806
Just Watching.

24:06.978 --> 24:09.276
These feelings... in my heart.
